{"ref":"BDB, רִמָּה²","hw":"רִמָּה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִמָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. worm (</strong>cause and sign of <em>decay</em><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:24\" href=\"/Exodus.16.24\">Ex 16:24</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.11\">Is 14:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלֵעָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 7:5\" href=\"/Job.7.5\">Jb 7:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 17:14\" href=\"/Job.17.14\">17:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 21:26\" href=\"/Job.21.26\">21:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:20\" href=\"/Job.24.20\">24:20</a> all indic. corruption, feeding on dead, etc.; hyperb. of insignificant man <a data-ref=\"Job 25:6\" href=\"/Job.25.6\">25:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלֵעָה</span>).","next":"BDB, רָמַם","prev":"BDB, רמם"}